Two of the four skills in this bundle started from that project and have been
substantially adapted:

  skills/grill-with-docs/  — derived from skills/engineering/grill-with-docs.
      Changed: the ADR tree (docs/adr/ plus an ADR format reference) was
      removed in favour of recording architectural trade-offs in the product
      spec's Architecture table; the multi-context CONTEXT-MAP.md machinery
      was dropped from both the skill and its CONTEXT-FORMAT reference; a
      SPEC-FORMAT reference and a blank-slate mode were added, along with a
      hand-off to the to-issues skill.

  skills/tdd/            — derived from skills/engineering/tdd.
      Changed: added an unattended mode that maps each "confirm with the user"
      planning step to a substitute for agents dispatched as issue workers,
      where no user is present; ADR references retargeted at the product spec;
      supporting documents moved into references/.

The other two skills, skills/to-issues/ and skills/orchestrate-issues/, are
original work with no upstream.

The upstream license follows in full, reproduced from
https://github.com/mattpocock/skills/blob/main/LICENSE.

